    {
      "name": "Scenario 2. Book Service down",
      "description": "Circuit Breaker, API Composition fallback, Health Check API.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Circuits (all Closed)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/diagnostics/circuits",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "diagnostics",
                "circuits"
              ]
            },
            "description": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Overview, Book Service down (send 3x)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/members/1/overview",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "members",
                "1",
                "overview"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**First, in the terminal:**\n\n    docker compose stop book-service\n\n1st: a few seconds (timeouts + retries), the circuit opens in the 1st or 2nd, then milliseconds. \"book\": null, \"degraded\": [\"book-service\"]."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Book 1 -> 503, circuit Open",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/books/1",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "books",
                "1"
              ]
            },
            "description": "503 at once: \"error\": \"book-service unavailable\", \"circuit\": \"Open\"."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Circuits (book-service Open)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/diagnostics/circuits",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "diagnostics",
                "circuits"
              ]
            },
            "description": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Book 1 -> 200 (trial call closes the circuit)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/books/1",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "books",
                "1"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**First, in the terminal:**\n\n    docker compose start book-service   (wait until healthy and 15 s have passed)\n\nLogs: Open -> HALF-OPEN -> CLOSED."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Circuits (all Closed again)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/diagnostics/circuits",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "diagnostics",
                "circuits"
              ]
            },
            "description": ""
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Scenario 3. Book Service slow or flaky",
      "description": "Circuit Breaker, timeout + retry (Polly), Externalized Configuration.\n\n**Afterwards, in the terminal:**\n\n    bash: docker compose up -d book-service\n    PowerShell: Remove-Item Env:BOOK_FAULT_FAILURE_RATE; docker compose up -d book-service",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Slow book (send 3x)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/books/1",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "books",
                "1"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**First, in the terminal:**\n\n    bash: BOOK_FAULT_DELAY_MS=3000 docker compose up -d book-service\n    PowerShell: $env:BOOK_FAULT_DELAY_MS=3000; docker compose up -d book-service\n\n1st: 503 after ~6 s (3 timeouts), 2nd: circuit opens, 3rd: 503 in milliseconds."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Circuits (book-service Open)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/diagnostics/circuits",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "diagnostics",
                "circuits"
              ]
            },
            "description": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Flaky book (send a few times)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/books/1",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "books",
                "1"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**First, in the terminal:**\n\n    bash: BOOK_FAULT_FAILURE_RATE=0.3 docker compose up -d book-service\n    PowerShell: Remove-Item Env:BOOK_FAULT_DELAY_MS; $env:BOOK_FAULT_FAILURE_RATE=0.3; docker compose up -d book-service\n    wait 15 s for the circuit\n\nFirst 200s (logs: 'attempt 1 failed (HTTP 500), retrying'), then the low-threshold circuit opens anyway."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
